{
  "name": "hemoglobin_detector",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "description": "## Project Overview This project implements a non-invasive hemoglobin and anemia detection system using optical sensing technology. The system measures blood oxygen levels (SpO2) and heart rate to estimate hemoglobin levels without requiring a blood sample.",
